type: software
title: "SkillPE: Creativity-Oriented Cinematic Skill Evolution for Text-to-Video Prompt Engineering"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  SkillPE evolves reusable cinematic skills for text-to-video prompt engineering
  using structured representations, reference-guided evolution, and assessment
  of generated videos.
keywords:
  - text-to-video generation
  - prompt engineering
  - cinematic skills
  - video generation
  - skill evolution
